Forecasting / Planning buttons under it make four pages, each with its own address (#forecast/raw/planning ...);
Forecast History has two (#forecast-history/raw, /graded). The raw pages are the tabs exactly as they were; the
graded pages are blank for now. Each tab reopens on the page used last.

